---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Meet Kirk | Owner-Operated Car Dealership & Financing in BC"
  description="Learn about Kirk's story and why he built an honest, personal dealership in British Columbia for newcomers, bruised credit, and everyday buyers."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <span class="badge-amber">Personal Service · Owner-Operated</span>
        <h1 class="about-title font-heading">
          "I answer my own phone. <span class="highlight">You deal with me from day one."</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="about-lead">
          I'm Kirk. I'm a licensed BC motor dealer based in the Fraser Valley. I built Kirk Auto because I was tired of watching corporate dealerships treat honest people with bruised credit like second-class citizens.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-stats">
          <div class="stat-box">
            <span class="stat-num font-heading">#[XXXXX]</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Licensed BC Dealer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-box">
            <span class="stat-num font-heading">20+</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Lending Partners</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-box">
            <span class="stat-num font-heading">15 min</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Average Text Reply</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-cta-row">
          <a href="sms:+17788882093?body=Hi%20Kirk%2C%20I'm%20on%20your%20About%20page%20and%20wanted%20to%20say%20hello" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Text Kirk: (778) 888-2093</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/pre-approval" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">
            See If You Qualify →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Kirk Video & Portrait Visual -->
      <div class="hero-media-card card">
        <div class="video-container">
          <div class="video-placeholder">
            <button type="button" class="video-play-btn" aria-label="Play Kirk's video greeting">
              <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
              </svg>
            </button>
            <div class="video-badge font-heading">30-Second Greeting From Kirk</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="media-caption">
          <div class="media-title">Kirk [Last Name]</div>
          <p class="media-desc">Filmed on his lot in Metro Vancouver. No professional studio, just Kirk talking straight.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Story Section -->
  <section class="story-section">
    <div class="container story-content">
      <div class="story-header">
        <span class="badge-green">The Backstory</span>
        <h2 class="section-title font-heading">Why I Don't Run a Traditional Dealership</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="story-body">
        <p>
          If you have an 850 credit score and $10,000 in cash, every car dealership in British Columbia will roll out the red carpet for you.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>But that's not real life for most people.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          Most of the people I talk to every single day are either brand new to Canada, recovering from a messy divorce, went through a consumer proposal, or had a business hiccup that ruined their score. They're good people with steady jobs who simply need a reliable car or truck to get to work and drive their kids around.
        </p>
        <p>
          At typical dealerships, they keep you waiting on a hard chair for 3 hours, run your credit through 8 different lenders without asking (which drops your score another 30 points), and then hit you with $1,500 in hidden "documentation and prep fees" when you're exhausted.
        </p>
        <p class="story-quote">
          "I wanted to build the opposite experience. One where you text me on your lunch break, get honest advice without judgment, know the exact bi-weekly payments upfront, and have the car delivered to your driveway."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How I Work: The 5 Guarantees -->
  <section class="guarantees-section" id="why-kirk">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-top text-center">
        <span class="badge-amber">Honest Business</span>
        <h2 class="section-title font-heading">The 5 Rules of How I Work With You</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">You are dealing with an independent business owner, not a sales quota.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="guarantees-grid">
        <div class="guarantee-card card">
          <div class="rule-number font-heading">01</div>
          <h3 class="rule-title">No Hard Credit Pull Without Your Say-So</h3>
          <p class="rule-desc">
            When you reach out, we look at your situation informally first. I do not run a hard credit check that dings your bureau until you and I have agreed on the numbers and vehicle.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="guarantee-card card">
          <div class="rule-number font-heading">02</div>
          <h3 class="rule-title">All-In Total Pricing (Zero Hidden Fees)</h3>
          <p class="rule-desc">
            Under BC vehicle advertising regulations (VSA BC), the price you see on my website is the total price. My doc fee is already included. The only thing added is legal provincial/federal tax.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="guarantee-card card">
          <div class="rule-number font-heading">03</div>
          <h3 class="rule-title">I'll Tell You Straight If It Won't Work</h3>
          <p class="rule-desc">
            I don't make fake promises like "100% guaranteed approval" because that doesn't exist. If your debt ratio is too tight or a payment will put you in danger, I will tell you honestly and suggest what to fix first.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="guarantee-card card">
          <div class="rule-number font-heading">04</div>
          <h3 class="rule-title">90% of the Work Happens Over Text</h3>
          <p class="rule-desc">
            You don't need to waste a whole Saturday sitting on a car lot. We exchange photos, video walkarounds, and bank documents securely by text and email.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="guarantee-card card">
          <div class="rule-number font-heading">05</div>
          <h3 class="rule-title">Doorstep Delivery in Metro Vancouver & Valley</h3>
          <p class="rule-desc">
            Once everything is approved and you're happy with the vehicle, I bring it right to your home or office. You inspect it, sign the paperwork, and get your keys.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Situations Kirk Handles -->
  <section class="who-i-help-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-top text-center">
        <span class="badge-green">Specialized Financing</span>
        <h2 class="section-title font-heading">Who I Help Across British Columbia</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="help-grid">
        <a href="/new-to-canada" class="help-card card">
          <h3 class="help-title font-heading">New to Canada / Work Permits</h3>
          <p class="help-desc">
            Zero Canadian credit? No problem. We use your job offer, SIN, and proof of income to secure bank approvals without astronomical subprime rates.
          </p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Read Newcomer Guide →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/consumer-proposal-car-loan" class="help-card card">
          <h3 class="help-title font-heading">Consumer Proposals & Bankruptcies</h3>
          <p class="help-desc">
            Actively in a proposal or recently discharged? Kirk works directly with lenders who understand proposal laws and help you re-establish your score.
          </p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Read Proposal Guide →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/first-car-no-credit" class="help-card card">
          <h3 class="help-title font-heading">First Time Buyers & No Credit</h3>
          <p class="help-desc">
            Starting out in the trades or your first real job? We help you get into a dependable vehicle without needing your parents to co-sign.
          </p>
          <span class="card-arrow">Read First Car Guide →</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/trucks" class="help-card card">
          <h3 class="help-title font-heading">Work Trucks & Lifted 4x4s</h3>
          <p class="help-desc">
            Need a reliable F-150, Ram, or Silverado for work or the backcountry? We keep affordable, inspected trucks ready to go.
          </p>
          <span class="card-arrow">View Trucks →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Closing Personal CTA -->
  <section class="personal-cta-section">
    <div class="container cta-card">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <span class="badge-amber">Direct Contact</span>
        <h2 class="cta-heading font-heading">Have a question? Text me directly.</h2>
        <p class="cta-lead">
          You don't need to fill out a lengthy formal application just to find out what's possible. Send me a quick text with what you're trying to do. I usually reply within 15 minutes during business hours.
        </p>

        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="sms:+17788882093?body=Hi%20Kirk%2C%20I'm%20looking%20for%20a%20vehicle%20and%20wanted%20to%20ask%20you%20a%20quick%20question" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>Text Kirk (778) 888-2093</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/17788882093?text=Hi%20Kirk%2C%20I'm%20reaching%20out%20from%20your%20website" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">
            <span>WhatsApp Chat</span>
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+17788882093" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">
            <span>Call (778) 888-2093</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* About Hero */
  .about-hero {
    padding: 64px 0;
    background: #FAF8F5;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    }
  }

  .hero-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5.5vw, 56px);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4A5568;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .hero-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .stat-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--dark-base);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hero-cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  /* Media Card */
  .hero-media-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .video-container {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 12;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A202C 0%, #2D3748 100%);
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .video-placeholder {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .video-play-btn {
    width: 76px;
    height: 76px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--dark-base);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .video-play-btn:hover {
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  .video-badge {
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #CBD5E1;
  }

  .media-caption {
    padding: 20px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .media-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .media-desc {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* Story Section */
  .story-section {
    padding: 72px 0;
  }

  .story-content {
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .story-header {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 48px);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .story-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .story-quote {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: #FAF8F5;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: #1F2937;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  /* Guarantees */
  .guarantees-section {
    padding: 72px 0;
    background: #FAF8F5;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .section-top {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .text-center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .guarantees-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .guarantee-card {
    padding: 32px 28px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .rule-number {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--amber);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .rule-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .rule-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4B5563;
  }

  /* Who I Help */
  .who-i-help-section {
    padding: 72px 0;
  }

  .help-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .help-card {
    padding: 28px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .help-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .help-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .help-desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .card-arrow {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Personal CTA */
  .personal-cta-section {
    padding: 64px 0 80px;
  }

  .cta-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 48px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .cta-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .cta-heading {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 48px);
  }

  .cta-lead {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4A5568;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
</style>
